.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/format_quote.svg)Cite\n- ![Show article permalink icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/share.svg)Permalink\n\n\n\n\n## PERMALINK\n\n\n\n![Copy icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/content_copy.svg)Copy\n\n\n![Open article navigation icon](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/list.svg)\n\nAs a library, NLM provides access to scientific literature. Inclusion in an NLM database does not imply endorsement of, or agreement with,\nthe contents by NLM or the National Institutes of Health.\n\nLearn more:\n[PMC Disclaimer](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/about/disclaimer/)\n\\|\n[PMC Copyright Notice](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/about/copyright/)\n\n![Nature Portfolio logo](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/banners/logo-npgopen.png)\n\nNat Aging\n\n. 2026 Feb 25;6(3):722–737. doi: [10.1038/s43587-026-01073-7](https://doi.org/10.1038/s43587-026-01073-7)\n\n- [Search in PMC](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour])\n- [Search in PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour])\n- [View in NLM Catalog](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nlmcatalog?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[Title%20Abbreviation])\n- [Add to search](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13004675/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour])\n\n# OMICmAge quantifies biological age by integrating multi-omics with electronic medical records\n\n[Qingwen Chen](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Chen%20Q%22[Author])\n\n### Qingwen Chen\n\n1Channing Division of Network Medicine, Department of Medicine, Brigham and Women’s Hospital and Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA USA\n\n2Department of Population Health Sciences, Duke University, Durham, NC USA\n\nFind artic