                   <section class=\"pmc-journal-banner text-center line-height-none\" aria-label=\"Journal banner\"><img src=\"https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/banners/logo-npgopen.png\" alt=\"Nature Portfolio logo\" usemap=\"#pmc-banner-imagemap\" width=\"500\" height=\"75\"><map name=\"pmc-banner-imagemap\"><area alt=\"Link to Nature Portfolio\" title=\"Link to Nature Portfolio\" shape=\"default\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s43587-026-01073-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></map></section><article lang=\"en\"><section aria-label=\"Article citation and metadata\"><section class=\"pmc-layout__citation font-secondary font-xs\"><div>\n<div class=\"display-inline-block\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cursor-pointer text-no-underline bg-transparent border-0 padding-0 text-left margin-0 text-normal text-primary\" aria-controls=\"journal_context_menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Nat Aging</button></div>. 2026 Feb 25;6(3):722–737. doi: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s43587-026-01073-7\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">10.1038/s43587-026-01073-7</a>\n</div>\n<nav id=\"journal_context_menu\"><ul class=\"menu-list font-family-ui\" role=\"menu\">\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/search/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour]\" class=\"usa-link\" role=\"menuitem\">Search in PMC</a></li>\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour]\" lang=\"en\" class=\"usa-link\" role=\"menuitem\">Search in PubMed</a></li>\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nlmcatalog?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[Title%20Abbreviation]\" class=\"usa-link\" role=\"menuitem\">View in NLM Catalog</a></li>\n<li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13004675/?term=%22Nat%20Aging%22[jour]\" class=\"usa-link\" role=\"menuitem\" data-add-to-search=\"true\">Add to search</a></li>\n</ul></nav></section><section class=\"front-matter\"><div class=\"ameta p font-secondary font-xs\">\n<hgroup><h1>OMICmAge quantifies biological age by integrating multi-omics with electronic medical records</h1></hgroup><div class=\"cg p\">\n<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Chen%20Q%22[Author]\" class=\"usa-link\" aria-describedby=\"id1\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"name western\">Qingwen Chen</span></a><div id=\"id1\">\n<h3><span class=\"name western\">Qingwen Chen</span></h3>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<sup>1</sup>Channing Division of Network Medicine, Department of Medicine, Brigham and Women’s Hospital and Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA USA </div>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<sup>2</sup>Department of Population Health Sciences, Duke University, Durham, NC USA </div>\n<div class=\"p\">Find articles by <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Chen%20Q%22[Author]\" class=\"usa-link\"><span class=\"name western\">Qingwen Chen</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<sup>1,</sup><sup>2,</sup><sup>#</sup>, <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Dwaraka%20VB%22[Author]\" class=\"usa-link\" aria-describedby=\"id2\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"name western\">Varun B Dwaraka</span></a><div id=\"id2\">\n<h3><span class=\"name western\">Varun B Dwaraka</span></h3>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<sup>3</sup>TruDiagnostic, Lexington, KY USA </div>\n<div class=\"p\">Find articles by <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Dwaraka%20VB%22[Author]\" class=\"usa-link\"><span class=\"name western\">Varun B Dwaraka</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<sup>3,</sup><sup>#</sup>, <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%22Carreras-Gallo%20N%22[Author]\" class=\"usa-link\" aria-describedby=\"id3\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"name western\">Natàlia Carreras-Gallo</span></a><div id=\"id3\">\n<h3><span class=\"name western\">Natàlia Carreras-Gallo</span></h3>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<sup>3</sup>TruDiagnostic, Lexington, KY USA </div>\n<div cl